# Per-extension CLAUDE.md and AGENTS.md files generated by `swamp repo init`
# The root CLAUDE.md / AGENTS.md is the single source of project guidance
**/CLAUDE.md
**/AGENTS.md
!/CLAUDE.md
!/AGENTS.md

# Per-extension .claude/ directories: ignore only swamp-managed scaffolding,
# but TRACK authored extension content such as skills under .claude/skills/.
# (kneel blanket-ignores **/.claude/ because it ships no authored skills;
# @shrug/content-studio bundles a content-review skill that must be tracked.)
**/.claude/worktrees/
**/.claude/settings.local.json
**/.claude/scheduled_tasks.lock
**/.claude/scheduled_tasks.json

# Git worktrees for isolated development
.worktrees/

# Swamp runtime state (databases, telemetry, caches, outputs)
# .swamp.yaml repo markers are NOT ignored -- only the .swamp/ directory
**/.swamp/

# Session scratch files
next-prompt.md

# Agent-generated design docs and iterative artifacts
# Kept as local reference, not project documentation, not committed.
/docs/
